  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and sauté until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add carrot, bell pepper, pumpkin, and tomatoes; cook for 3-4 minutes until vegetables begin to soften.",
    "Sprinkle in curry powder, turmeric, cumin, coriander, salt, and pepper; stir to coat vegetables evenly.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and single cream, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes until sauce thickens and veggies are tender.",
    "Stir in lime juice and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Remove from heat and sprinkle chopped cilantro on top.",
    "Serve hot over steamed rice or millet, optionally with a side of grilled tofu or fish."
  ],
